This product fetches data from a public U.S. government API:
  - ClinicalTrials.gov API v2 (https://clinicaltrials.gov/api/v2), maintained by the
    National Library of Medicine (NLM), National Institutes of Health.
ClinicalTrials.gov data is made available by the U.S. National Library of Medicine as
public domain information; some records can carry submitter-supplied material, so
read the site's terms (https://clinicaltrials.gov/about-site/terms-conditions). This
project is independent. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by NLM, the
NIH or any other U.S. government agency. No API key is needed or used.

Endpoint paths were checked against the official OpenAPI specification published at
https://clinicaltrials.gov/api/oas/v2. The endpoint and field dictionary in
schema/ctgov.json is curated by hand and verified against that specification and the
live metadata endpoint by scripts/regenerate-sdk.ts (the pinned subset is
schema/openapi.pinned.json); its provenance block records the sources. Only field
names and descriptions are kept; API responses are not distributed.

The web portal bundle (dist/web) includes third-party open-source packages; their
license texts are collected at build time in dist/web/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt.
